5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited to get started! I want to see where our budget is actually going, so I'll pick Loan transport costs over three seasons and Mount-making charges and joiner's rate.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I'll look into the Conservation lab staffing and backlog, as well as the Composition of the volunteer roster. It's important to know who is available to support the exhibition.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll go with Weekend head counts across ten seasons and Five years of visitor comment slips. I want to see what actually brings people back to the museum.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the Structural survey of the suspended bay and the Evening hire bookings in the gallery to ensure the space can handle the requirements.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I think it would be wise to look at the Lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the Maintenance log for powered displays. We must ensure everything arrives and functions as planned.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Does anyone else think we should check the visitor comments? @Shion, I'm curious if you think the numbers or the comments will be more telling!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I believe both are valuable, but the comments might reveal the emotional connection visitors have with our displays, which numbers alone cannot capture.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, the numbers provide the hard truth, but the comments explain the ""why."" I suspect the data will show a pattern that the curators usually ignore.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"While the ""why"" is interesting, we cannot ignore the physical constraints of the gallery. If the space cannot support the exhibition, the visitor's emotional connection becomes irrelevant.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, Asuka, let's not be too stern. We all have different pieces of the puzzle, and each one is important for a successful season.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"You're right, Shizue! I just want to make sure we aren't surprised by any hidden costs. @Asuka, do you think the evening bookings often clash with the types of exhibits we usually pick?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"It is a possibility. If we choose an installation that is too fragile or sprawling, the movement of catering staff and furniture during those hires could pose a significant risk.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"It seems we are all focusing on risks. While avoiding disaster is necessary, we shouldn't forget that the main gallery's primary purpose is to attract and engage the public.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Engagement is a goal, Shion, but it must be a sustainable one. I am simply ensuring that our ambitions do not exceed the structural reality of the building.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with Asuka's caution, but I also believe in the magic of a well-planned show. Let's see what our research reveals before we worry too much.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm just so eager to see the results! I'll stick with my choices for now. I hope we find a way to make a wonderful show that doesn't break the bank!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. I will remain focused on our human resources to ensure we don't overextend our staff. I look forward to seeing what everyone discovers.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'll stick to my data. I'm interested to see if the public's actual preferences align with the committee's instincts. Let's move to the findings.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,My choices remain the same. I believe the physical and logistical data will be the most critical factor in narrowing down our options.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall keep my selections as well. I hope we find the clarity we need to avoid any unfortunate surprises this coming season.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
